# (tree-sitter v0.26.10)
# ts_query_new may leak an inner CaptureQuantifiers buffer on error-unwind
# when a query pattern names an unknown field after a capture has been parsed
# under it. The early `return TSQueryErrorField` at
# lib/src/query.c:2841 skips the `capture_quantifiers_delete(&field_capture_quantifiers)`
# that other exits from that block perform.
leak:capture_quantifiers_add_for_id
